or conferences it hosts each year. By virtue of its direct ties to Sidoti, Events benefits from Sidoti's small- and microcap-focused nationwide sales force, which has connections with over 2,500 institutional relationships in North America. This enables Events to provide multiple forums for meaningful interaction for small and microcap issuers and investors specifically interested in companies in the sector."]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["SOURCE:"]}," Sidoti \u0026 Company, LLC"]}]},"language":"en","tags":[{"title":"ACCESS Newswire","args":[{"id":"provider","value":"acceswire"}]},{"title":"Strategy, business, and products","args":[{"id":"section","value":"strategy_business_products"}]},{"title":"US stocks","args":[{"id":"category","value":"stock"},{"id":"market_country","value":"US"}]}],"id":"acceswire:533237672094b:0","title":"Sidoti Events, LLC's September Small-Cap Virtual Conference","published":1790084700,"urgency":2,"link":"https://www.accessnewswire.com/newsroom/en/banking-and-financial-services/sidoti-events-llcs-september-small-cap-virtual-conference-1225171","relatedSymbols":[{"symbol":"AMEX:ACU","logoid":"acme","logo":{"style":"single","logoid":"acme"}},{"symbol":"NYSE:AP","logoid":"ampco-pittsburgh-series-a","logo":{"style":"single","logoid":"ampco-pittsburgh-series-a"}},{"symbol":"NYSE:AZZ","logoid":"azz","logo":{"style":"single","logoid":"azz"}},{"symbol":"NASDAQ:BOSC","logoid":"bos-better-online-solutions","logo":{"style":"single","logoid":"bos-better-online-solutions"}},{"symbol":"NYSE:BHE","logoid":"benchmark-electronics","logo":{"style":"single","logoid":"benchmark-electronics"}},{"symbol":"NYSE:BRC","logoid":"brady","logo":{"style":"single","logoid":"brady"}},{"symbol":"NYSE:CFND","logoid":"c1-fund","logo":{"style":"single","logoid":"c1-fund"}},{"symbol":"NASDAQ:CRAI","logoid":"cra-international","logo":{"style":"single","logoid":"cra-international"}},{"symbol":"TSX:CLCH","logoid":"clinch-resources-ltd","logo":{"style":"single